34,2,1,talk,Rin,,"The island houses are actually pretty cheap per person, but the all-in meal rates mean everyone pays the same regardless of how much they eat!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The ferry takes up two whole days of the trip, but the train to the spa valley is only ninety minutes. I'm leaning away from the island.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Last time, separate rooms had a huge price difference between us, but renting a whole building means the bill is split evenly.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"The inn has strict mealtimes and we'd all be on futons in one room, but the baths are open almost all day. The island houses only have one bathroom for everyone.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"When we shared a house, there was no place to be alone, but last year we spent the whole day apart without even realizing it.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if the island is cheap, maybe the long ferry ride is worth it? But I don't like the idea of paying for food I might not eat!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Two days of travel is a steep price for a cheap house, Rin. I'd rather spend my time on vacation than on a boat.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"If we want a fair split, the island house is the most logical choice, but the all-in meal rates are problematic for those with different appetites.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"I can't do one bathroom for five people. That sounds like a nightmare. I'd rather have the inn's baths, even if we have to sleep in one room.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"It seems we need a balance. The island house is too crowded, but the city break might leave us too disconnected, as happened last year.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Rin,,"But the city break has separate rooms! @Asuka, wouldn't that mean the prices are all different again? I don't want to be surprised by the bill at the end!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,Exactly. A city break sounds like a logistical mess of separate bookings and varying costs. The spa valley seems like the most efficient middle ground.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"Rin is right; separate city rooms would likely lead to the same price discrepancies we saw last time, which is exactly what I want to avoid.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not sure about the inn's one-room setup, but at least the city has its own doors. Still, the spa valley sounds better than fighting over one bathroom on an island.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"If we go to the city, we risk drifting apart again. The spa valley keeps us together but offers more space than a single house.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm still worried about the money, but the spa valley sounds like a good compromise! Let's see if the total cost there is clear.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"The spa valley is fast, efficient, and keeps us together without wasting days on a ferry. I'm fully on board with that.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"The spa valley's all-in rates might be a bit unfair for some, but it's more predictable than the city's separate bookings. I can support that.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Takumi,,I can live with the futons if it means I don't have to wait in line for one bathroom all week. The spa valley it is.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"The spa valley seems to offer the right balance of togetherness and personal space, avoiding the extremes of the other two options. I agree.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
