59,3,1,talk,Rin,,I'm voting for the Hot Spring Town! It sounds like the best way to keep the costs simple and the travel short!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'm voting for the Hot Spring Town as well. It's the only option that doesn't waste my time or create a logistical headache.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Asuka,,I'll vote for the Hot Spring Town too. It's the most predictable option for the budget and avoids the unfairness of separate bookings.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm voting for the Hot Spring Town. I can handle the one room as long as the bathing situation is good.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Toshio,,I'll vote for the Hot Spring Town. It seems the most likely to keep us together without feeling suffocated.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
